  "document": "RM-201 synthetic trend check - 2026-03-04\n\n- Don't mix up freshAir.m_flow sign with physical air into room. Source command is negative because of port convention.\n- Outside trace = 0.0004557 kg/kg = 300 ppm under project rounding.\n- \"100 kg/kg\" at peopleSource looks crazy but is intentional. carrier m_flow * 100 gives actual CO2 kg/s.\n- New schedule peaks at 15 people after lunch. Old .mo file only peaks at 12.\n- New tuning Kp 6, bias 3.5 ACH. Integral off in reference run.\n- Trend maximum I see: about 996.52 ppm at around 14:59.\n- Controller bottoms at 0.2 ACH for long unoccupied periods.\n- Room is treated perfectly mixed; no local sensor stratification modeled.\n- Sensor-fault fallback is a requirement but not injected in the baseline trend.\n",
